---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Brevrix" 
  description="Privacy Policy, Cookie usage, and data protection standards at Brevrix (brevrix.com)."
  currentPath="/privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
    <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-6 mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">Legal & Transparency</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mt-2 mb-3 font-heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Last Updated: November 2, 2026 • Effective Worldwide</p>
    </div>

    <p>
      At <strong>Brevrix</strong> (<a href="https://brevrix.com" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">https://brevrix.com</a>), accessible from our main website and blog subdirectories, protecting the privacy of our visitors and clients is one of our fundamental priorities. This document outlines the types of information collected and how it is used.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you fill out our contact form, project inquiry brief, or interactive project estimator, we collect basic contact details such as your name, email address, company name, and technical project specifications strictly to communicate with you and prepare requested proposals.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">2. Cookies, Google Analytics & Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>
      We use standard log files and cookies to analyze traffic, improve site performance, and ensure optimal user experiences. Third-party vendors, including <strong>Google</strong>, may use cookies (such as the DoubleClick DART cookie) to serve relevant advertisements based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites on the internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-400 underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">3. Client Data & Code Confidentiality</h2>
    <p>
      Any server credentials, API tokens, source code, database schemas, or financial records shared with Brevrix during a consulting or engineering engagement are treated as strictly confidential under strict Non-Disclosure standards. We never sell, rent, or distribute client data to any third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">4. Hosting Infrastructure & Security</h2>
    <p>
      Our web properties are hosted on enterprise edge networks (Cloudflare Pages) utilizing TLS 1.3 encryption, automatic SSL certificate rotation, and modern security headers to prevent unauthorized interception.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">5. Contact Information</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions, feedback, or data privacy requests regarding this policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-400 underline">Contact Page</a> or email us directly at <strong>taanvir1839@gmail.com</strong>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

